Rebalance_childToRemoteChild_CcipFork
├── given the active strategy is Arbitrum Aave V3
├── and TVL exists in the Arbitrum child strategy
├── when CRE initiates rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── and CRE executes rebalance through Arbitrum Child WorkflowRouter
├── then ChildVault should withdraw all TVL from Arbitrum Aave V3
├── and ChildVault should send the TVL to Ethereum or Polygon through local CCIP
├── and Ethereum or Polygon ChildVault should deposit the TVL into Ethereum or Polygon Aave V3
├── and Arbitrum ChildVault should clear its active adapter
├── when CRE completes rebalance through Parent WorkflowRouter
├── then ParentVault should finalize the rebalance
├── and ParentVault should increment the rebalance nonce
└── and the active strategy should be Ethereum or Polygon Aave V3
